==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[thyroid]] [[gland]]}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} A large butterfly-shaped [[endocrine gland]] situated on the front of the neck that produces various [[hormone]]s. Removal due to thyroid [[cancer]] is termed a total [[thyroidectomy]].

